local_consoles_json.description:
JSON array describing your local UDMs for Network + Protect data. ONE API key per UDM grants access to both Network and Protect surfaces. Example:
[
  {"hostId":"6C63...","name":"Udm-Pro-Urb","url":"https://192.168.3.1","apiKey":"YOUR_LOCAL_KEY"},
  {"hostId":"245A...","name":"UDM-Pro","url":"https://192.168.1.1","apiKey":"YOUR_LOCAL_KEY"}
]
Get hostId from `list_hosts`. Generate each apiKey on its UDM at Settings → Control Plane → Integrations. Leave blank to use cloud only.
